	(descr "MARV V2 solder pad row, 1x9, 2.00 mm pitch, 1.4x2.2 mm oval SMD pads on F.Cu only. Wire/flex solder landing for the ESC pad row J3 (6 ESC signals + 5V in + GND + VBAT sense); no connector body, no 3D model. There is NO silkscreen outline - the row sits hard against the board edge between two grommet GND rings and an outline reaches both; pad 1 is marked by a silkscreen dot only, per-pad function labels are added as silkscreen text at layout.")
